,"issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nHappens in 4.8 beta 1, but not 4.8 dev 7.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.beta1 - Arch Linux #1 ZEN SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat, 03 Oct 2026 11:43:26 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor (1600x900 @ 76.00 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 SUPER (nvidia; 615.78.08) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.53 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the Filesystem panel, right clicking a folder, and using the Create New dropdown to create anything like Folders, TextFiles, or Resources, crashes the editor before you can even choose a name for it.\nDoes not happen when selecting empty space in the panel.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project.\n2. In the filesystem dock, right click the res:// folder.\n3. Under the Create New dropdown, select anything\n4. The editor will crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[New Game Project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33625203/New.Game.Project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.g